==English==

===Etymology===
{{suffix|tooth|less}}

===Adjective===
{{en-adj}}

# Having no [[teeth]].
#:''a '''toothless''' old man''
# {{figuratively}} [[weak|Weak]], having no capability of enforcing something.
#:''The treaty was '''toothless''' in combatting climate change.''

